Step : Install Terraform using WinGet
First check whether WinGet is available:
winget --version

Then install it:
winget install Hashicorp.Terraform

Restart your terminal
terraform version
Verify Windows can locate Terraform - " where.exe terraform " then - Get-Command terraform

Check Terraform commands - terraform

Step 1: Create your first Terraform file
code main.tf 
VS Code should open a file named: main.tf
      terraform {
      required_version = ">= 1.16.0"
      }
save S

Step 2: Initialize Terraform  
  terraform init

Step 3: Format the file
  terraform fmt
  terraform validate
